WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.210
Tag the miss. Get the fix.

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:09.726
After a missed lift, tap Miss. Then pick how it missed. In front, behind, or press-out.

00:00:10.167 --> 00:00:16.854
You get the likely causes. Then the drills that fix them, and a cue. All matched to your tag.

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:21.619
Download Barforge Weightlifting. No account. Free to start.
